 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "With what shall I come before the LORD, and bow down before God on high",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 15.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With what shall I come before the LORD, and bow down before God on high",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 1.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Shall I burn him a year-old calf and send the smoke up to the sky",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will the LORD be pleased with thousands of rams, with ten thousand rivers of oil",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will the LORD be pleased with thousands of rams, with ten thousand rivers of oil",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shall I give my firstborn for my transgression, the fruit of my body for the sin of my soul",
   "heard": 19,
   "words": 19,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has told you, O man, what is good",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And what the LORD requires of you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only to do justice",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To love mercy",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And to walk humbly with your God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 24.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have seen the altar smoking while the widow's door was shut",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Seen a hand raised up in worship while the other filled its cup",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He is not after cattle and he is not after show",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.72,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He wants an honest heart and a humble road to go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He has told you, O man, what is good",
